+
+<h1>Publication 527 (2025), Residential Rental Property</h1>
+
+<div>
+<h2 class="subtitle">(Including Rental of Vacation Homes)</h2>
+</div>
+
+<div>
+<p class="pubdate">For use in preparing <em><span class="remark">2025</span></em> Returns</p>
+</div>
+</div>
