+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-715.</span> Frequency of ad valorem taxation on personal property; exception.<br /><br />
+	Notwithstanding any other provision of law, no personal property may be taxed for ad valorem purposes more than once in any tax year, except as provided for by the provisions of Section 56-3-210.<br /><br />
